  unitName: "Dark Deemo and the Girl (5\u2605)"
  unitId: 60864
  unitNumber: 1171
  description: A mysterious girl with another Deemo guardian who suddenly appeared
    in Ishgria when Deemo and the Girl left Grand Gaia. It would seem that these
    two duos share some sort of relationship, but the real identity of either party
    remains to be determined. Rumor has it that this dark rendition of Deemo and
    the Girl manifested itself from Ishgria's demonic power after the pair crossed
    the gate to another world.
  summonDesc: Did you summon us here?<br>Then I'll let you experience<br>our intense
    and transcendent music.
  fusionDesc: You're giving me power?<br>Then we'll have to make it up to you<br>with
    our music.
